    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban food delivery companies from paying riders 'per delivery'",
        "additional_details": "Many delivery apps such as Uber Eats and Deliveroo currently pay riders a 'per delivery ' fee, instead of an hourly rate. We think the government should ban this and enforce hourly pay of at least minimum wage.",
